  unitName: Goddess Alvitr (EU)
  unitId: 750115
  unitNumber: 7034
  description: Part of the pantheon of fierce warriors coming from the coldest territories
    of Grand Gaia. Their legend tells us that 6 exceptional semi-goddesses select
    among the best of dying combatants, whom would be granted the right to enter
    their heaven and fight side by side with the gods. Alvitr is faster than ever.
    She brings countless souls the their respective heavens and some have started
    to voice a concern over the quantity!
